   "updated": 1795600000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "What it MEANS: two messages are \"the same event\" if and only if their canonicalized, selected fields are byte-identical.\nEverything dangerous about hash keys follows from this one sentence.",
   "originalText": "What it MEANS: two messages are \"the same event\" if and only if their canonicalized, selected fields are byte-identical.\nEverything dangerous about hash keys follows from this one sentence.",
